                "description": "Partially updates an account user.\n\nOmitted fields are left unchanged. Profile fields (`name`, `email`, `username`) update the underlying user, which is shared across every account the user belongs to.\n\nThis endpoint requires the permissions: `team:update`, `customers:update`, `suppliers:update`.",
                "method": "PATCH",
                "path": "/v1/identity/account-users/{id}",
                "domain": "identity",
                "tag": "Account Users",
                "tagSlug": "account-users",
                "endpointSlug": "update-account-user",
