                "operationId": "add-item-attribute",
                "summary": "Add Item Attribute",
                "description": "Adds an attribute to an item and returns the updated item.\n\nIf the attribute is already associated with the item, this is a no-op.\n\nThis endpoint requires the permission: `items:update`.",
